# Introduction

Reproducibility is central to empirical work. Foundational treatments of data
science establish the methods this survey builds upon [@jones2019]. Domain
applications, such as climate modeling, demonstrate the stakes of verifiable
output [@smith2020].

# Discussion

Online resources have made these techniques broadly accessible [@lee2021].
Conference results confirm that the approach scales [@garcia2022].

# Conclusion

Author-date citation, as used here, pairs naturally with deterministic
rendering.

